# Verifiable Fleet Transaction

Concept-ID: `SOUNIO-VERIFIABLE-FLEET-TRANSACTION`

Status: executable for the bounded runtime and nominal language kernel. This is
not a priority or novelty claim. The current witness establishes local protocol
properties under the declared model and trust boundaries; it does not establish
Byzantine consensus, durable execution across host loss, or public transparency.

